  ②                                  \n\n③          ④ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.25 한국서부발전 (매일경제)","originalId":"2025p2-e08-m03","number":3},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e08-m03-q.webp","width":678,"height":737},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e08-m03-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1469}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P086-S1-Q04","number":4,"question":"25.05.25 한국서부발전 (매일경제) · 객관식 4번","searchText":" 04\n\n도체에 2A 의 전류를 10분간 흘렸을 때, 도체 단면을 통\n\n과한 총 전하량C은?\n\n\n① 1800         ② 1600\n\n③ 1200         ④ 1000","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.25 한국서부발전 (매일경제)","originalId":"2025p2-e08-m04","number":4},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e08-m04-q.webp","width":696,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e08-m04-e1.webp","width":696,"height":366}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P086-S1-Q05","number":5,"question":"25.05.25 한국서부발전 (매일경제) · 객관식 5번","searchText":" 05\n\n비유전율이 인 유전체 내의 한 점에서 전계가\nVm일 때, 이 점의 분극의 세기 Cm는?\n\n\n                      \n①            ②     \n                      \n③            ④     ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.25 한국서부발전 (매일경제)","originalId":"2025p2-e08-m05","number":5},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/ass