-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e08-m07-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1340}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P086-S1-Q08","number":8,"question":"25.05.25 한국서부발전 (매일경제) · 객관식 8번","searchText":" 08\n\n10A 의 전류가 흐르고 있을 때, 0.1초 동안 통과하는 전\n\n자 수는 약 몇 개 인가?\n(단, 전자 1개의 전하는 × C이다.)\n\n\n① ×       ② × \n③ ×       ④ × ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.25 한국서부발전 (매일경제)","originalId":"2025p2-e08-m08","number":8},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e08-m08-q.webp","width":678,"height":496},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e08-m08-e1.webp","width":678,"height":742}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P086-S1-Q09","number":9,"question":"25.05.25 한국서부발전 (매일경제) · 객관식 9번","searchText":" 09\n\n다음 수식에 관하여 설명하는 법칙은?\n\n             \n\n\n\n① 암페어의 법칙     ② 렌츠의 법칙\n\n③ 플레밍 오른손 법칙  ④ 톰슨의 법칙","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.25 한국서부발전 (매일경제)","originalId":"2025p2-e08-m09","number":9},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e08-m09-q.webp","width":678,"height":398},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e08-m09-e1.webp","width":678,"height":540}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":f