 역상 임피던스이다.)\n\n\n\n\n\n                          \n①              ②          \n                  \n③                ④             ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.25 한국서부발전 (매일경제)","originalId":"2025p2-e08-m19","number":19},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e08-m19-q.webp","width":678,"height":937},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e08-m19-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e08-m19-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1883}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P086-S1-Q20","number":20,"question":"25.05.25 한국서부발전 (매일경제) · 객관식 20번","searchText":" 20\n\n\n전자파의 위상정수가                      주파수가       radm이고,\nMHz일 때, 전파속도 ms는?\n\n\n① ×         ② × \n③ ×         ④ × ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.25 한국서부발전 (매일경제)","originalId":"2025p2-e08-m20","number":20},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e08-m20-q.webp","width":678,"height":482},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e08-m20-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1008}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P086-S1-Q21","number":21,"question":"25.05.25 한국서부발전 (매일경제) · 객관식 21번","searchText":" 21\n\nΩ, F인 직렬회로에서 일 때\nV의 직류전압을 인가하는 경우, 회로에 흐르는\n\n과도전류 A 는?\n\n\n①        ② 