n③            ④  ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.25 한국서부발전 (매일경제)","originalId":"2025p2-e08-m23","number":23},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e08-m23-q.webp","width":696,"height":759},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e08-m23-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1230}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P086-S1-Q24","number":24,"question":"25.05.25 한국서부발전 (매일경제) · 객관식 24번","searchText":" 24\n\n3상 동기발전기의 주파수가 Hz, 회전자의 주변속도가\n\nms, 극수가 일 때, 회전자의 반경m와 , , \n\n의 관계가 옳은 것은?\n\n\n                             \n①         ② \n\n                           \n③            ④       ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.25 한국서부발전 (매일경제)","originalId":"2025p2-e08-m24","number":24},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e08-m24-q.webp","width":696,"height":441},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e08-m24-e1.webp","width":678,"height":652}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P086-S1-Q25","number":25,"question":"25.05.25 한국서부발전 (매일경제) · 객관식 25번","searchText":" 25\n\n단상 변압기의 %저항강하가 3, %리액턴스강하가 5\n\n이고, 부하의 역률이 앞선역률로 80일 때, 변압기\n\n의 전압변동률은?\n\n(단, %리액턴스강하는 앞선역률일 때 이다.)\n\n\n① -0.6         ② -0.5\n\n③ -0.2         ④ 0.6","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.25 한국서부발전 (매일경제)","originalId":"2025p2-e08-m25","number":25},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e08-m25-q.webp","width":678,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e08-m25-e1.webp","width":696,"height":816}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]}]}
